"}},{"title":"山中逢老僧 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"拟把苍烟付老閒，廿年形影不离山。\n窗前一树盘空老，曾是天台拾子还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45447,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中逢老僧 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"一抹青烟沉远峦，禅心汰得似冰寒。\n閒山閒水都休却，付与瞻风衲子看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45448,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中逢老僧 其三","author":"袁宏道","text":"念珠策得定功成，绝壑松涛夜夜行。\n说与时贤都不省，依稀记得老阳明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45449,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中逢老僧 其四","author":"袁宏道","text":"一室长关谷底泉，儿孙阅过几霜颠。\n松根夜壁时来往，不省人间有睡眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45450,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中逢老僧 其五","author":"袁宏道","text":"爱把苍竿搅月湍，山风吹顶不曾寒。\n竹林寺里寻常去，乞得西僧梵本看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45451,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中逢老僧 其六","author":"袁宏道","text":"课得西崖杉柏成，山中知面不知名。\n少时曾学收云法，拟把一囊送我行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45452,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中逢老僧 其七","author":"袁宏道","text":"坐破松岩不记年，衲衣长是裹溪烟。\n天池寺里犹嫌近，更住天池绝巘边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45453,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明空住柳浪五月附余舟南下别于归宗道上因作柳浪三叠以送之 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"青池白石每谈空，销却寒缸几炷红。\n记取柳浪湖上柳，夜禅听尽碧丝风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45454,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明空住柳浪五月附余舟南下别于归宗道上因作柳浪三叠以送之 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"碧溪影里一僧归，漾得云光上衲衣。\n记取柳浪湖上水，縠纹风起鹭鸶飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45455,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明空住柳浪五月附余舟南下别于归宗道上因作柳浪三叠以送之 其三","author":"袁宏道","text":"不炉话尽晚窗烟，閒剔春芽自煮泉。\n记取柳浪湖上月，隔花呼起放生船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45456,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过归宗寺","author":"袁宏道","text":"墨池秋水石苔寒，晋碣唐书野火残。\n一丈草青绀殿里，争教赤眼不心酸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45457,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芜湖舟中同范长白念公看月 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"夜深蕉帢带寒澌，隔水青梧辨露枝。\n问取无心老衲子，几人消得幻琉璃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45458,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芜湖舟中同范长白念公看月 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"夜泉香锻石垆红，听尽寒松带雪风。\n算取人间几月子，江心瓯面复瓶中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45459,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芜湖舟中同范长白念公看月 其三","author":"袁宏道","text":"青山不改黛螺春，孤閤娉婷是女神。\n一脔秋光半匣水，人间多少热忙人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45460,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采石蛾眉亭 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"空江石壁瘦鳞鳞，腻绿颓斑酣冶春。\n扫取山光为黛粉，尽教荡子作仙人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45461,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采石蛾眉亭 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"拟将杯棬作家乡，卧月横烟梦几场。\n况是蛾眉消得死，争教白也不郎当。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45462,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采石蛾眉亭 其三","author":"袁宏道","text":"是处烟岚挂齿否，懒将时事罥心神。\n青山也许人酬价，学得云閒是主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45463,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白门逢焦师座主 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"十年一拜郑康成，搔首青山独自行。\n一即读书倦即枕，不将无事换公卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45464,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白门逢焦师座主 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"赤轴犹如水泻瓶，草颠书尽万梢青。\n而今老矣都休却，日课杂花两卷经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45465,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侯师之水轩 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"架书狼籍粉虫残，六月之纱溅水寒。\n麾却如花旧拍板，茶瓶相对白蔬盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45466,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侯师之水轩 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"卷叶寒来多少时，形言眼语亦能知。\n白头闻得无生事，学把胡珠唤老师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45467,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月六日舟中忆去年此日与大兄都城归义寺别泫然念及大姑自云明岁二三月当还出笼不远因大笑而别今大姑与兄俱逝矣哀哉 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"别时犹记带馀诙，夹毂风生满面灰。\n屈指来年一二月，大姑含笑长孙来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45468,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月六日舟中忆去年此日与大兄都城归义寺别泫然念及大姑自云明岁二三月当还出笼不远因大笑而别今大姑与兄俱逝矣哀哉 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"伏惑虽然学圣流，难辞真恸到眉头。\n独形独影空舟里，自说因缘自解愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45469,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月六日舟中忆去年此日与大兄都城归义寺别泫然念及大姑自云明岁二三月当还出笼不远因大笑而别今大姑与兄俱逝矣哀哉 其三","author":"袁宏道","text":"闻说南中也破颜，几回梦上九华山。\n而今恰走南中路，不是生游是死还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45470,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月六日舟中忆去年此日与大兄都城归义寺别泫然念及大姑自云明岁二三月当还出笼不远因大笑而别今大姑与兄俱逝矣哀哉 其四","author":"袁宏道","text":"饶他白发倍耆年，那得三朝无恶缘。\n一刻未离一刻苦，争如长夜却先眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45471,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月六日舟中忆去年此日与大兄都城归义寺别泫然念及大姑自云明岁二三月当还出笼不远因大笑而别今大姑与兄俱逝矣哀哉 其五","author":"袁宏道","text":"灯前肠痛子瞻诗，宿世他生自可知。\n邮馆暂来还暂去，莲花聚首是长时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45472,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋中偶同诸友作时萟","author":"袁宏道","text":"少时飞将气如腾，老去常思韝上鹰。\n抽得健儿金镞矢，等閒亲角两三朋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45473,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕偶题 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"螺甲香沉蜡焰残，黄柑历历耀青盘。\n朝来令节侯官长，当去红衫欲赎难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45474,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕偶题 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"白酒青盐强作欢，长歌到底意摧残。\n当时京邸团圞日，只作寻常聚会看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45475,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬寅元日","author":"袁宏道","text":"不图宴坐与澄神，只要烟岚过眼新。\n算取开年得意事，衲头随著住山人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45476,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕度门出宫中月饼同赋 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"曾向昭容于内传，绿绨亲押圣人前。\n三千里路秦宫月，和雪和烟到楚天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45477,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕度门出宫中月饼同赋 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"盘中犹折半宫花，刻凤攒龙自内家。\n不是国师争袖得，也应坠破紫袈裟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45478,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕度门出宫中月饼同赋 其三","author":"袁宏道","text":"曾是金娥印得成，留将旧样说阴晴。\n等閒放出中秋月，并与春灯一夜明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45479,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]